WEBVTT

00:03.380 --> 00:04.230
Dantak,

00:04.830 --> 00:07.300
you are the only Hill Giant left.

00:07.900 --> 00:10.200
Why are you doing this?

00:10.840 --> 00:12.210
Because you're indolent.

00:12.700 --> 00:14.170
Indolent?

00:14.780 --> 00:17.830
You are a monster,
and yet you stay holed up

00:17.830 --> 00:19.670
in your castle without killing humans,

00:20.240 --> 00:22.460
which is against Lord Demis' instruction.

00:22.820 --> 00:24.810
Who the hell are you?!

00:26.660 --> 00:28.220
I am the avenger of evil,

00:28.660 --> 00:29.770
Van the Hero!

00:30.760 --> 00:32.049
Hero?

00:32.640 --> 00:34.610
Someone like you...!

00:40.220 --> 00:41.600
Evil has perished.

00:42.500 --> 00:44.580
Van, that's cool!

00:44.580 --> 00:46.750
This person is dangerous...

01:05.250 --> 01:11.970
BANISHED FROM THE HERO'S PARTY, I DECIDED TO
LIVE A QUIET LIFE IN THE COUNTRYSIDE SEASON 2

02:23.290 --> 02:27.500
#8 ALL FOR THE SAKE OF BLESSINGS AND FAITH

02:28.880 --> 02:31.630
It smells good, Ms. Esther.

02:32.040 --> 02:33.770
Would you like to join me for dinner?

02:34.160 --> 02:35.880
Where's everyone else?

02:36.330 --> 02:38.910
Van and Lavender went
to hunt some monsters.

02:39.420 --> 02:41.650
Mr. Lub is resting soundly.

02:43.600 --> 02:45.310
Then, I would like to join you.

02:51.970 --> 02:55.460
It's been a long time since we sat around
a campfire together like this.

02:55.460 --> 02:56.130
Yes.

02:56.990 --> 02:58.230
By the way,

02:58.750 --> 03:01.770
I didn't expect you could cook,
Ms. Theodora.

03:02.170 --> 03:03.770
I learned the cooking skill.

03:04.240 --> 03:06.060
It's surprisingly fun.

03:07.220 --> 03:09.790
Perhaps it's because of Mr. Red?

03:10.230 --> 03:10.880
Yeah.

03:11.530 --> 03:13.140
I want to be like him.

03:13.740 --> 03:17.750
Not only as a cook but also as someone
who supports and guides the heroes.

03:18.640 --> 03:21.810
But every day,
I realize that I'm not good enough.

03:22.130 --> 03:25.730
That's not true. It can't be helped
since he's that kind of hero.

03:26.090 --> 03:28.490
Mr. Albert was worried about you too.

03:30.800 --> 03:34.540
Albert? I have put him
through a lot of hardship.

03:34.540 --> 03:40.200
But Mr. Albert is proud
when he talks about you, Ms. Theodora,

03:40.200 --> 03:42.910
and he's happy that he can
work together with you.

03:43.350 --> 03:46.040
Eh? Albert did?

03:46.380 --> 03:47.170
Yes, he is.

03:47.930 --> 03:50.980
He seemed lonely because he couldn't
see you, Ms. Theodora.

03:51.560 --> 03:52.940
Lonely?

03:52.940 --> 03:55.840
You mean he misses me
because he couldn't see me?

03:57.810 --> 04:00.250
I-Is that so?

04:00.250 --> 04:06.150
No, I miss him too, or I want to meet him
as soon as the situation permits...

04:06.150 --> 04:07.940
Ah! No...! I mean...!

04:08.230 --> 04:10.570
What am I saying?

04:10.940 --> 04:14.230
Don't get me wrong!
I'm just saying

04:14.230 --> 04:17.500
that I'd like to see him as a friend,
a colleague, or something!

04:18.420 --> 04:20.720
A-Anyway, that's what I mean!

04:21.120 --> 04:24.130
Oh, I'm getting thirsty.

04:24.130 --> 04:26.500
I'll get some water.

04:30.770 --> 04:31.750
Are you a maiden?!

04:36.990 --> 04:38.550
Fresh from the oven!

04:38.550 --> 04:40.600
The village's specialty, curry bread!

04:40.600 --> 04:42.850
Go ahead and eat as much as you like!

04:43.110 --> 04:45.040
Come on, don't be shy!

04:47.670 --> 04:49.870
All three meals are curry.

04:54.280 --> 04:58.520
I can't get enough of this
savory smell and deep spiciness!

04:58.520 --> 05:00.620
The white bread is fried in oil!

05:00.970 --> 05:02.960
This is the ultimate luxury.

05:03.300 --> 05:04.880
It's all curry inside.

05:04.880 --> 05:06.420
It's curry bread, after all.

05:06.420 --> 05:09.370
Woah! Look at that!

05:09.370 --> 05:10.340
Amazing!

05:10.340 --> 05:11.920
Where are they going?

05:13.790 --> 05:17.800
It's unusual for pegasus
to pass through this village.

05:17.800 --> 05:21.130
Talking about unusual,
I've never seen one before.

05:21.750 --> 05:24.220
It's like they're running away
from something.

05:27.530 --> 05:28.600
Something is coming.

05:37.740 --> 05:43.240
It is said that the fairy king's shield
can use mind manipulation magic.

05:45.920 --> 05:48.000
You know how dangerous that is, right?

05:48.000 --> 05:50.000
Another sermon?

05:50.320 --> 05:52.500
You're so noisy!

05:53.120 --> 05:55.110
It depends on how you use it, doesn't it?

05:55.660 --> 05:57.650
In the hands of the righteous,

05:57.650 --> 06:01.010
it can lead the wicked to faith.

06:01.340 --> 06:04.650
Being forced to pray
by magic is not faith.

06:05.330 --> 06:07.220
It should be sealed.

06:08.040 --> 06:09.730
It belongs to Van!

06:09.730 --> 06:12.340
How he uses it is none of your business!

06:18.500 --> 06:21.080
We're just going to hand over
the airship to the Hero,

06:21.080 --> 06:25.210
but is it okay to hold a party like this?

06:25.210 --> 06:28.400
I think it will be all right this time.

06:28.400 --> 06:31.450
It's what the Hero
wanted the most, you know.

06:34.130 --> 06:36.110
Okay, this should be fine.

06:36.440 --> 06:37.500
Mogrim!

06:37.910 --> 06:39.810
How is your wife?

06:39.810 --> 06:44.170
I told her to rest, but she's
not listening to me at all!

06:44.170 --> 06:45.600
And I'm not happy about it!

06:46.040 --> 06:48.010
Well, she'll be fine.

06:48.420 --> 06:52.890
But you've got to be there for her
and don't push her too much.

06:53.220 --> 06:55.390
I know that.

07:02.480 --> 07:05.030
Wyn, how's the new business going?

07:05.330 --> 07:08.270
It's just starting to pay off.

07:08.270 --> 07:11.160
The mushrooms from
the Zug forest are very fragrant

07:11.160 --> 07:13.500
and are in great demand around here.

07:13.760 --> 07:15.850
Oh, what a good business!

07:15.850 --> 07:17.050
You should buy us a drink!

07:17.050 --> 07:21.020
Huh?! Why should
I buy you guys a drink?!

07:21.020 --> 07:22.880
It's you guys who should buy me!

07:23.500 --> 07:25.880
Come on, man, just a little!

07:26.130 --> 07:27.640
Show your manliness!

07:27.640 --> 07:29.450
Are you an idiot?!

07:29.450 --> 07:30.640
Hey, I'm not an idiot!

07:30.640 --> 07:32.810
You guys!

07:32.810 --> 07:35.450
You should learn from the kids a little bit!

07:35.450 --> 07:35.810
Huh?

07:36.620 --> 07:39.500
Hello. Please give me one.

07:41.460 --> 07:44.130
I'm sure the Hero will be happy
to have it, right?

07:44.130 --> 07:45.820
Yeah, that's right.

07:46.220 --> 07:47.610
That's not true.

07:47.610 --> 07:50.320
What you are talking about
is not happiness.

07:50.770 --> 07:51.950
It's called depravity.

07:54.720 --> 07:57.180
The hero is back!

07:59.430 --> 08:02.840
I see. So you finally found the airship?

08:03.120 --> 08:04.020
Yes.

08:04.350 --> 08:09.060
Now, please go over there
and give a toast to the celebration.

08:09.340 --> 08:10.900
Hero!

08:10.900 --> 08:12.850
Congratulations!

08:13.260 --> 08:14.230
Again?

08:14.900 --> 08:16.730
There's no need for a celebration here.

08:18.710 --> 08:21.850
Mr. Mayor, I appreciate
your thoughtfulness,

08:21.850 --> 08:24.690
but we are in a hurry,
so we would like to take our leave.

08:26.540 --> 08:27.780
I understand.

08:28.060 --> 08:32.809
I, too, apologize for not considering
the weight of your mission.

08:33.169 --> 08:38.210
I pray to Lord Demis
for the success of your journey.

08:38.630 --> 08:41.210
The prayers of heretics
will not reach God.

08:51.330 --> 08:54.500
Van! What you're saying is too rude!

08:54.500 --> 08:56.850
You should apologize to them.

08:57.430 --> 08:59.560
No, that is not necessary.

09:00.400 --> 09:03.260
I am a Hero
who was educated as a monk.

09:03.900 --> 09:07.440
Converting those heretics
is one of my important goals.

09:07.880 --> 09:10.020
What is he talking about?

09:10.020 --> 09:14.470
As long as there is a blessing, of course
everyone believes in Lord Demis.

09:15.140 --> 09:17.280
But to call them heretics...

09:20.870 --> 09:22.770
M-My stomach sick...

09:24.200 --> 09:27.980
Hero, that is an insult to us.

09:28.380 --> 09:31.050
What makes you call us heretics?

09:31.530 --> 09:35.260
That's because you people are living
in this place slothfully and pointlessly.

09:35.620 --> 09:37.350
As the scriptures say,

09:37.350 --> 09:41.270
idleness is the felony of abandoning
the role God has given you.

09:41.990 --> 09:44.770
You must repent.

09:45.660 --> 09:47.780
There is only one thing
for you to do:

09:51.340 --> 09:53.680
Fight the Demon King's Army
together with me!

09:54.540 --> 09:55.870
Fight the...

09:55.870 --> 09:57.320
...Demon King's Army?

09:58.140 --> 10:02.830
It is your sacred duty
to fight together with the hero!

10:03.580 --> 10:06.200
We have a country to protect

10:06.200 --> 10:07.230
and a life to live!

10:07.230 --> 10:08.840
You should just abandon your country.

10:09.830 --> 10:12.360
What is the value of this
remote country, after all?

10:14.790 --> 10:15.690
This is bad.

10:18.050 --> 10:22.660
Zoltan is a land that our grandparents
worked so hard to cultivate.

10:22.660 --> 10:24.800
That is outrageously rude of you

10:24.800 --> 10:28.780
to ask us to abandon our land,
even if you are a Hero!

10:28.780 --> 10:29.640
Rude?

10:30.220 --> 10:32.420
Rudeness is just a rule
between people.

10:32.730 --> 10:34.780
What I am preaching is faith.

10:43.580 --> 10:45.430
Why are they like this?

10:45.760 --> 10:49.300
All the people here really love Zoltan.

10:50.000 --> 10:52.220
They want to cherish

10:52.220 --> 10:54.630
their peaceful life here.

10:57.510 --> 10:58.890
This conversation is pointless.

11:01.220 --> 11:02.430
What are you going to do?!

11:02.820 --> 11:03.640
Stop it!

11:04.390 --> 11:06.310
I won't let you interfere with Van.

11:06.620 --> 11:07.570
Get out of my way!

11:07.570 --> 11:11.030
What Van is trying to do
is not the behavior of a Hero!

11:11.360 --> 11:14.730
I agree with you, but so what?

11:14.730 --> 11:19.030
What Van is trying to do
is all right with me.

11:25.610 --> 11:26.880
This magic...

11:27.460 --> 11:28.670
Could it be...?!

11:31.690 --> 11:32.380
Mr. Lub!

11:35.920 --> 11:38.930
Well, Van should try to fail once.

11:38.930 --> 11:42.510
A little damage in a remote
country like this won't hurt

11:42.510 --> 11:45.140
his reputation as a Hero.

11:45.140 --> 11:45.810
What?!

11:46.170 --> 11:48.820
Tisse, you stay put.

11:49.400 --> 11:51.520
If you get in Van's way, I'll kill you.

11:54.650 --> 11:55.280
This is...

11:55.660 --> 11:57.780
This is the shield of the fairy king.

11:58.380 --> 12:02.250
It has the power to bring you back
to faith and save you.

12:03.540 --> 12:08.170
Lord Demis will not forgive you for
living in peace while the Hero is here!

12:08.580 --> 12:12.270
Come, fight with me against
the Demon King's army!

12:15.820 --> 12:17.010
Thorn Bind!

12:18.950 --> 12:19.620
What?

12:21.040 --> 12:24.140
Hero Van, you shouldn't do that.

12:24.580 --> 12:25.320
Who are you?

12:26.500 --> 12:29.230
I'm just a high elf
who lives here in Zoltan.

12:31.790 --> 12:34.370
To think you would use
mind manipulation magic...

12:34.370 --> 12:36.150
Just how villainous are you?

12:36.400 --> 12:38.520
Do you call a Hero a villain?

12:38.940 --> 12:41.130
You are the evil that deceives goodness.

12:44.920 --> 12:46.160
I am Van the Hero,

12:46.570 --> 12:47.950
the avenger of evil!

12:49.090 --> 12:50.300
Weed Sting!

13:04.370 --> 13:05.540
- Let's get out of here!

13:05.540 --> 13:06.720
- Hurry up!
- Let's get out of here!

13:16.530 --> 13:17.440
Martial Arts!

13:18.460 --> 13:21.660
Comet Crash Kick!

13:27.570 --> 13:29.120
That was close.

13:29.620 --> 13:30.460
Danan!

13:30.460 --> 13:33.010
It's hard to fight a Hero alone, isn't it?

13:33.010 --> 13:34.330
I'll help you.

13:34.610 --> 13:36.300
He seems pretty tough.

13:36.300 --> 13:37.520
I know.

13:38.510 --> 13:40.470
Why doesn't he use healing?

13:40.470 --> 13:42.920
If he's a hero, doesn't he have
a Healing Hand?

13:42.920 --> 13:43.950
Who knows?

13:44.600 --> 13:47.720
Even if he has a superhuman body,
there must be pain he receives.

13:48.710 --> 13:50.470
Two evils are here!

13:51.160 --> 13:54.060
But I'm a Hero!
I won't give in to evil!

13:54.380 --> 13:55.820
I see.

13:55.820 --> 14:00.070
What's holding him back is
his belief in his own blessing.

14:00.450 --> 14:03.320
I'm going to knock him down
and break his nose!

14:04.320 --> 14:07.830
Lord Demis, please witness
my fight as a Hero.

14:10.910 --> 14:13.960
Martial Arts! Ferocious Tiger King Claw!

14:14.270 --> 14:16.790
Martial Arts! Holy Blade!

14:24.820 --> 14:25.860
I'll support you.

14:37.660 --> 14:38.730
It hurts...

14:39.260 --> 14:39.940
But...!

14:40.470 --> 14:42.320
The hero will not falter!

14:43.260 --> 14:44.660
Healing Hand Mastery,

14:45.050 --> 14:45.990
Reverse!

14:52.220 --> 14:53.250
Amazing.

14:53.650 --> 14:57.000
I was in a lot of pain,
but you're not holding back at all.

14:57.400 --> 14:59.670
You are worthy of being
the enemy of a Hero!

15:00.060 --> 15:00.960
Are you okay?

15:03.050 --> 15:05.140
Did you transfer your wound?

15:05.500 --> 15:07.930
I don't think that is the skill of a Hero.

15:07.930 --> 15:11.660
It's a skill that regenerates one's own wounds
with the life force of the opponent.

15:12.120 --> 15:16.290
I can turn the tables on any
adversity with this skill.

15:16.290 --> 15:19.940
No matter how powerful the evil is,
a Hero never falters!

15:20.420 --> 15:25.380
How can you call yourself a Hero
by giving your pain to others?!

15:26.510 --> 15:30.160
It was the great Lord Demis
who decided on me as the Hero.

15:31.170 --> 15:33.600
You are denying the will of God.

15:34.370 --> 15:35.880
There is no greater heresy than you.

15:45.410 --> 15:50.300
You who have slaughtered our kind
and stolen our treasure!

15:50.300 --> 15:54.470
The time has come for you to taste
our wrath and vengeance!

15:54.960 --> 15:56.140
Evil dragons!

15:56.830 --> 15:58.850
You came to take back my shield?

16:02.780 --> 16:04.360
O Great Spirit of the Giant Tree!

16:14.330 --> 16:17.790
My power is not a good match against
the Salt Dragon's power.

16:18.110 --> 16:20.420
If we don't do something,
the town will be destroyed!

16:20.420 --> 16:20.920
Yeah.

16:21.390 --> 16:21.990
I know it!

16:21.990 --> 16:22.920
Got you!

16:23.800 --> 16:24.420
You...!

16:24.980 --> 16:26.550
O Great Spirit of the Giant Tree!

16:30.230 --> 16:31.760
Oh, that was close.

16:31.760 --> 16:35.600
A true hero should think
of saving the people first!

16:36.010 --> 16:38.220
This is also the will of Lord Demis.

16:38.990 --> 16:41.910
If the Salt Dragon destroys this country,

16:42.610 --> 16:44.190
the lazy Zoltans

16:44.190 --> 16:47.650
will be motivated to fight against
the Demon King's army, won't they?

16:47.650 --> 16:50.980
Cut the crap out of your nonsense!

16:50.980 --> 16:52.910
I'll kill you first!

16:55.990 --> 16:57.620
Healing Hand Mastery...

16:58.120 --> 16:58.960
Reverse!

17:09.540 --> 17:10.760
Sorry to keep you waiting.

17:11.079 --> 17:11.940
Red!

17:12.250 --> 17:13.760
Why are you here?

17:19.940 --> 17:20.980
What are you doing?!

17:25.960 --> 17:27.030
You...!

17:48.380 --> 17:50.350
The Salt Dragon is chasing us.

17:50.890 --> 17:52.590
Van will catch up to us soon.

17:53.340 --> 17:55.300
Thank you, Mr. Crawly Wawly.

17:56.030 --> 17:58.230
I wouldn't have made it
to Danan and the others

17:58.230 --> 18:00.340
if it wasn't for your spider thread.

18:02.250 --> 18:07.070
Now, I'm going to do my best to respond
to your efforts, Mr. Crawly Wawly.

18:10.440 --> 18:12.030
Please listen to me!

18:18.980 --> 18:21.180
Tremendous bloodlust!

18:21.180 --> 18:22.320
It's a Hero.

18:22.320 --> 18:23.020
Huh?

18:23.490 --> 18:25.330
Listen to me for a second.

18:25.680 --> 18:28.980
I came all this way to return this.

18:29.660 --> 18:31.590
It was yours to begin with, wasn't it?

18:32.460 --> 18:37.430
Yes. This is the treasure that was entrusted
to us by the previous Demon King.

18:37.790 --> 18:38.800
I knew it.

18:39.540 --> 18:40.540
Please take it.

18:49.870 --> 18:52.580
You must be careful of that Hero.

18:54.490 --> 18:56.650
I appreciate your warning.

18:57.300 --> 18:58.240
- Martial Arts!
- But...

18:58.540 --> 18:59.440
it's too late now.

18:59.440 --> 19:01.100
Holy Blade!

19:06.580 --> 19:10.550
Ah, this is going to be a problem
for people passing through here.

19:11.180 --> 19:13.190
You've failed as a Hero.

19:13.880 --> 19:15.110
Are you a heretic too?

19:15.500 --> 19:16.180
There!

19:18.520 --> 19:20.660
If you can't swing a sword,

19:20.660 --> 19:23.000
you can't make it sharp.

19:23.000 --> 19:24.790
You...!

19:24.790 --> 19:25.940
Get away from me!

19:26.230 --> 19:28.550
Your blessing level seems to be increasing,

19:28.550 --> 19:30.440
but your swordsmanship training is lacking.

19:30.820 --> 19:32.910
Compared to the power of blessing,

19:32.910 --> 19:35.700
the idea of swordsmanship
is just a pittance!

19:36.020 --> 19:39.130
Oh, you're the type to think like that?

19:39.620 --> 19:44.700
That's why you were lured out of town,
far away from your companions.

19:45.800 --> 19:47.540
If swords don't work,
I can use magic!

19:51.100 --> 19:53.760
Don't ever think you can use magic
in this kind of situation.

19:54.070 --> 19:56.280
Why are you stalling for time like this?

19:56.730 --> 19:59.640
A hero can fight all night!

20:00.050 --> 20:02.540
I'm not going to take that long.

20:02.880 --> 20:03.640
That's because...

20:07.020 --> 20:07.620
Who...?

20:20.300 --> 20:22.500
W... Who...

20:24.500 --> 20:26.360
I don't have a name to give you.

20:26.740 --> 20:28.540
Just forget it tomorrow.

20:29.490 --> 20:31.250
Van's companions will be here soon.

20:31.580 --> 20:33.530
Let's get out of here before they see us.

20:33.830 --> 20:34.320
Yes.

20:39.410 --> 20:40.530
It's cold...

20:41.740 --> 20:44.440
Ah, that's right,
I'm going to die...

20:45.780 --> 20:47.160
The Hero has lost...

20:51.020 --> 20:52.000
This is fine...

20:53.220 --> 20:55.860
The role of a Hero is to fight evil,

20:56.710 --> 20:58.380
not to win.

20:59.760 --> 21:02.120
I have fulfilled my role...

21:03.780 --> 21:07.100
But why was it with that girl?

21:08.230 --> 21:11.980
If everything that happens
is Lord Demis' will,

21:12.860 --> 21:16.060
then meeting that girl
must have a meaning...

21:22.920 --> 21:24.180
I see...

21:31.600 --> 21:33.060
Healing Hands...

21:39.120 --> 21:42.360
Are you okay?! It hurt, didn't it?
I'm sorry!

21:42.710 --> 21:45.010
I'll be by your side from now on!

21:47.320 --> 21:49.750
This is my role too, isn't it?

21:50.960 --> 21:51.680
Van?

21:52.850 --> 21:54.750
I'll kill that girl.

21:55.880 --> 21:59.220
And I'll become the 'true' Hero.

22:02.540 --> 22:04.510
Come to me, my Lord!
